    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69564" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μωλέω</span></b> , Cret. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μωλίω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>contend,
				bring an action at law</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴ κα
				μωλῇ, αἰ δέ κ᾽ ἀνφὶ δώλῳ μωλίωντι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Leg.Gort.</u>
				1.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μωλιόμενα</span>
			<i>the pleadings</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				5.44
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μωλιομένας τᾶδ δίκας</span>
			<i>while</i> the case <i>is being pleaded</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.48
			</span></i>:—<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ&lt;ω&gt;λεῖ: μάχεται,
				πικρανθήσεται</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μωλήσεται:
				μαχήσεται</span>.</div>
